Fast-path self-chain transitions with idle timing, no scalar starts/tails and preserved clean lanes.
Retain history, commits, PC, accounting, stop/budget/depth checks and the generic fallback.
The two cached predicates fit the existing Slot padding (static_assert keeps its 128-byte ABI).
No gameplay performance measurement is claimed by this patch.

